WEBVTT

00:16:58.498 --> 00:17:00.076
Now I only have about 30 seconds,

00:17:00.100 --> 00:17:01.998
so I want to start an animation,

00:17:02.022 --> 00:17:03.417
and we'll conclude with that.

00:17:03.441 --> 00:17:04.829
Thank you.

00:17:04.853 --> 00:17:08.976
(Applause)

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:10.976
Chris asked me to add --

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:12.776
the theater is under construction,

00:17:12.800 --> 00:17:15.524
and this project will start
construction in about a year,

00:17:15.548 --> 00:17:16.699
and finish in 2010.

00:17:16.723 --> 00:17:17.985
[identify public elements]

00:17:18.009 --> 00:17:19.596
[insert public elements at grade]

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:22.040
[optimize tower dimensions]

00:17:22.412 --> 00:17:23.745
[place towers on site]

00:17:24.115 --> 00:17:26.394
[lift program]

00:17:26.418 --> 00:17:28.197
[flip!]

00:17:28.221 --> 00:17:29.809
[optimize program adjacencies]

00:17:29.833 --> 00:17:31.226
[connect to context]